Error [E0926]: a schedule interval must be a positive duration
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_duration_zero.jet:3:9
    |
  3 | #Every(0ms)
    |         ^^
 Why: `#Every(0ms)` or a negative duration never becomes due — it isn't a real cadence.
 Fix: write a duration greater than zero, e.g. `#Every(5min)`.
